e |\n\nKey catches: index 0 of palettes 1–3 is a dead register — the only backdrop is palette 0 slot 0 (PPU `$3F00`); the HUD text is *not* a separate palette (it shares palette 2 with the cloud); and the HUD coin is a background tile on palette 3, not the hidden behind-background sprite.\n\nAll four were recorded (`mapping_type: palette`, ids 0–3) and promoted — the mapping file now holds 5 palettes. Palette overrides are cleared and the emulator is paused on the clean first screen; save slot 0 holds it for retries."}
